OL,3,GNEWSAFormer nightclub could become
OL,4,Acouncil offices
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former nightclub and railway station
OL,7,Fbuilding that has been derelict for a
OL,8,Fdecade could be brought back to life
OL,9,Fand used as council offices.
OL,11,FNorfolk Railway Foundation, a charity
OL,12,Fthat preserves the county's railway
OL,13,Fhistory, wants to renovate Cromer
OL,14,FStation House, and Cromer Town Council
OL,15,Fsaid it wanted to move in.
OL,17,FThe 19th Century building is located
OL,18,Fnext to the town's station on Holt Road
OL,19,Fand is one of the first buildings
OL,20,Fpeople see when they get off the train.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
